  theText: Why in the world did you do this??!!!! are you frickling stupid JETPACKULAA!!!!!
    you dont even know what this "beta" world is!! you know i bet someone is writing
    this DIO right now at 10:14 in the afternoon because he's dreading having to
    actually build this thing and put it on the stupid Itch because he hasnt read
    all of the requirements and probobly missed something!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! anyways
    are we just gonna keep falling forever? how long is this thing anyways. how long
    can I ranble before i run out of things to say. yo bro. did you know that im
    your brother that katana Joe almost killed and to save my life you turned me
    into a jetpack... yeah... pretty funny bro. anyways imma list some random words
    that you wouldn't understand unless you were that guy now at 10:18 writing this...
    lets seen.... Bin Man, Turdle-erdl-man, Beanos, Ude, Yuzumpast, the old man,
    general D, doctor Red, frick  I ran out of stuff....... okay.... I think the
    insanity is gone.. what's is insanity again? something about expecting different
    outcomes... anyways
  nextText: {fileID: 11400000}
